ID: B2-Ch04a-Rules
TEXT:

"I've never heard of this game before. Could you please teach me the rules?"

"Think you're clever?" The thug's fingers wrap around his dagger hilt as he rises. "People who joke with me usually end up bleeding on the stones."

"Easy," Wilhelm says, resting a palm on the thug's shoulder. "We're supposed to be a team, remember?"

"Get your filthy hand off me, gutter trash," the thug snaps.

For a split second, Wilhelm's pleasant smile vanishes, replaced by cold, lethal venom. Before anyone can react, Bruce lets out a booming bark of laughter.

