choice("Continue", B2-Ch04a-Strategy, v_current_scene = B2-Ch04a-Strategy)


ID: B2-Ch04a-Strategy
TEXT:

#if(v_b2_ch4_inform == 0) {
Before the tension boils over, large glowing blue letters materialize in the air between us.

"Pardon the interruption," the script reads, "but we should discuss strategy for tomorrow, if everyone agrees."

We all look over at Leila. She stands with her arms crossed, glaring at the group.

"Right, well..." Bruce rubs the back of his neck. "Can't argue with that."

"Agreed," Wilhelm says.

"And discuss what, exactly?" the mage grumbles. "The guards haven't given us a scrap of intelligence. All we know is that round one involves mythical beasts."

Leila catches my eye.

I wonder if she's having second thoughts about withholding our cavern findings. If I want to share what we learned, this is the moment.

}
#if(v_b2_ch4_inform == 1) {
