choice("Continue", B2-Ch04a-Stats, v_current_scene = B2-Ch04a-Stats, v_available_points = +3, v_available_points_aux = +3)


ID: B2-Ch04a-Stats
TEXT:

#if(v_ch11_saved_rose == 1) {
We return to our division's pen, where the rest of the fighters stand waiting against the iron grating that looks out over the arena floor. The stands are nearly packed now, tens of thousands of voices merging into a low, reverberating roar. I scan the rising stone tiers for Flower or Rose, but at this distance, faces blur into a sea of cloth and moving silhouettes. High above the royal box, the announcer taps a rune on his bronze voice-magnifier, checking the magical amplification.

}
#if(v_ch11_saved_rose == 0) {
We return to our division's pen, where the rest of the fighters stand waiting against the iron grating that looks out over the arena floor. The stands are nearly packed now, tens of thousands of voices merging into a low, reverberating roar. I scan the rising stone tiers for Flower, but at this distance, faces blur into a sea of cloth and moving silhouettes. High above the royal box, the announcer taps a rune on his bronze voice-magnifier, checking the magical amplification.

}
A sharp, rhythmic chirp sounds from my pocket. An identical tone chirps from Leila's belt.

Finally. Three points banked.

