We file out onto the blood-soaked sand, stepping over crushed carapaces and severed limbs toward the center of the pit.

"Ladies and gentlemen—the fourth division!" the announcer booms.

The crowd falls dead silent. Nobody recognizes a single face in our lineup. To thirty thousand spectators, we're just the next batch of meat for the grinder.

Time to prove them wrong.

}
